{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現年47歲的「6號」陸浩明與模特兒女友陳詩欣拍拖多年，一直愛得相當高調甜蜜。今日（28日）6號終於向大家狂掟震撼彈，在社交網報喜宣布求婚成功，正式結束愛情長跑，準備迎娶靚靚女友。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455676189246316_708533.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20269uDnOTmhNH1787898917.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455676189246316_708533.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">為了給女友一個畢生難忘的求婚儀式，6號今次可謂花盡心思。兩人近日飛到馬爾代夫旅行，他特意在水清沙幼的沙灘上進行悉心佈置，更準備了極具情調的燭光晚宴。現場除了有精緻鮮花，還備有寫上「Will You Marry Me」的心形求婚蛋糕，浪漫指數爆燈。從分享的相片可見，6號單膝下跪情深獻上求婚戒指，陳詩欣瞬間感動得掩面甜笑，隨後更興奮地激動熊抱未婚夫，場面Sweet到漏，隔住個Mon都感受到這份幸福。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026d8zxUZ3fCU1787898917.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455710330847683_708533.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">求婚成功後，6號難掩激動心情，在社交網發表超深情「愛的宣言」瘋狂放閃：「Yeah! 我求婚成功🫶🏻我會用一萬倍嘅努力，讓妳幸福快樂❤️求婚時聽到你天使般嘅笑聲令我最甜蜜感動，以後嘅日子，你會成為我最幸福嘅家人。遇上妳係我一生最大嘅禮物 Love You 小公主」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這則超甜喜訊一出，一班圈中好友包括袁偉豪、張寶兒、林淑敏和黃嘉雯等，亦紛紛湧入留言區大排長龍送上誠摯祝福，齊齊恭喜這對準新人踏入人生新階段！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455749757394679_708533.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026yAFdHL9Fch1787898917.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455749757394679_708533.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bSKHsg7Bsq1787898916.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"lukhoo_1787893192_3973455770972247298_708533.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T06:59:11.363625+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":493,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}